# Images — now served from Cloudinary (upcell/ folder tree).
# Uploaded by Backend/scripts/migrate-images-to-cloudinary.js; the id for each
# file is recorded in Backend/scripts/cloudinary-manifest.json. These stay on
# disk as a local fallback but are no longer shipped in the repo or the build.
public/product-images/
public/adds/
public/staticImages/*
# The favicon is the one exception: index.html requests it before any JS runs,
# so it must exist as a real file in the deployed build.
!public/staticImages/faviconUpcell.png
